; Sand5-24: island scale-up (docs/21_WORLD_SCALE_AND_MAINLANDS.md §2/§9 task 1).
; Same tile piece and scale as Sand1-4 (no stretching, per the doc's explicit
; guidance) tiled outward in three more rings to grow the terrain footprint
; from ~24u across to a ~76-80u rounded-square, matching the new 38u collision
; radius. Ring centres: 19.0u (x8), 25.46u (x4), 30.59u (x8) from origin; the
; two outermost corner positions (dist 35u/42.4u) are deliberately omitted to
; round the shape instead of leaving a full square.

